"description":"Transform your phone or tablet into the ultimate rehearsal and stage companion.\n\nLyricsFlow Pro is the professional digital songbook and teleprompter/scroller designed specifically for singers, guitarists, bass players, keyboard players, bands, and worship leaders. Say goodbye to heavy 3-ring binders, and the anxiety of forgetting lyrics. Whether you are rehearsing in the garage or performing at a sold-out venue, LyricsFlow Pro puts your entire repertoire at your fingertips.\n\nDesigned by musicians for musicians, this app combines powerful ChordPro rendering with a sleek, distraction-free interface that ensures you never miss a beat or a lyric.\n\nTHE ULTIMATE PERFORMANCE TOOL: LyricsFlow Pro’s Auto-Scroll engine acts as your personal teleprompter.\n\nVariable Speed Control: Set the perfect scroll speed for each individual song. The app remembers your settings for every track.\n\nTouch-to-Pause: Tap pause, manually scroll up and down or use the nudge buttons.\n\nStage Countdown: A visual countdown timer displays at the beginning and end of each song to give you time.\n\nPROFESSIONAL SONG MANAGEMENT Importing your library is seamless. LyricsFlow Pro supports the industry-standard ChordPro format, making it compatible with thousands of songs available online.\n\nSmart Import: Automatically extracts Title, Artist, Lyrics and Chords from directives in .cho, .crd, .chopro, .chordpro, and .txt files.\n\nChordPro Support: Full support for standard directives like {title:}, {artist:}, and {subtitle:}.\n\nVisual Chords: The app identifies chords e.g. [Am7] and displays them in a custom colour of your choice, distinct from the lyrics. Perfect for guitarists, bassists and keyboard players who need harmonic cues at a glance.\n\nSONG SECTIONS: Use Quick Insert to add the sections such as Verse 1, Chorus, Bridge etc in bold and in the colour set in settings.\n\nGIG-READY SET LISTS: Set up set lists for all your gigs. The player will scroll and advance the songs automatically in the order you set.\n\nDRAG AND DROP: Easily re-order songs in seconds to adapt to the crowd's energy.\n\nCOLOUR SCHEMES FOR ANY VENUE: Poor lighting can ruin a performance. LyricsFlow Pro ensures readability in any environment.\n\n15 Pro Themes: Choose from 11 diverse colour schemes and background themes.\n\nDARK MODE: Switch the apps user interface to dark mode to save eye strain.\n\nLighting Optimisation: Select high-contrast \"Dark Mode\" themes for dark clubs to prevent screen glare, or high-visibility light themes for outdoor daytime festivals.\n\nTotal Font Control: Adjust font sizes for each song. Make your lyrics massive for easy reading from a distance, or smaller to fit more lines on the screen.\n\nBACKUP & RESTORE (NEW!) Your repertoire is your life's work. Keep it safe.\n\nSecure Export: The comprehensive Backup & Restore feature allows you to export your entire database—including songs, setlists, and custom settings—to a single file.\n\nData Portability: Save your backup to your device or upload it to cloud storage.\n\nEasy Restoration: Seamlessly restore your library if you switch devices or need to sync setups with a bandmate.\n\nWHY LYRICSFLOW PRO?\n\nFor Singers: The teleprompter-style scroll ensures you never forget a line.\nFor Musicians: Clear chord rendering and key transposition.\nFor Bands: Use the countdown and setlists to keep everyone on the same page.\n\nStop fumbling with paper. Upgrade to the digital songbook that works as hard as you do.\n\nDownload LyricsFlow Pro today and take command of your stage!\n\nVisit: https://lyricsflowpro.co.uk for more information and to use our free ChordPro Wizard to create your songs.\n\nDISCLAIMER: This app contains no demo data or copyrighted material. It is the user's responsibility to ensure that they have relevant permissions to use any songs or lyrics.", "genres":["Music", "Productivity"], "userRatingCount":0}]
